        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "edf720bb-292d-5c3e-986f-a4b8555315f6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jasmin Geljo, George A. Romero\n- Works: Cube Zero, Land of the Dead, Assault on Precinct 13, The Sentinel, Night of the Living Dead, Dawn of the Dead, Day of the Dead, Diary of the Dead, Survival of the Dead\n- Topics: acting careers, horror films, Living Dead series\n\nFacts:\n- Jasmin Geljo was born on September 18, 1959, and is a Bosnian-Canadian actor.\n- Land of the Dead is a 2005 post-apocalyptic horror film written and directed by George A. Romero.\n- Land of the Dead is the fourth of George A. Romero's six Living Dead films.\n- The Living Dead films preceding Land of the Dead are Night of the Living Dead, Dawn of the Dead, and Day of the Dead.\n- The Living Dead films succeeding Land of the Dead are Diary of the Dead and Survival of the Dead.\n- Jasmin Geljo is best known for playing Ryjkin in Cube Zero and for roles in Land of the Dead, Assault on Precinct 13, and The Sentinel.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
